-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/l00lpdtp/board-453758_1280.jpg?width=800\u0026amp;height=600\u0026amp;v=1dc0778c459ed50\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 1x, https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/l00lpdtp/board-453758_1280.jpg?width=1600\u0026amp;height=1200\u0026amp;v=1dc0778c459ed50\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 2x\u0022 height=\u0022600\u0022 type=\u0022image/webp\u0022 width=\u0022800\u0022/\u003E\n\u003Cimg alt=\u0022Close up image of a green electrical circuit board\u0022 class=\u0022lazyload\u0022 data-srcset=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/l00lpdtp/board-453758_1280.jpg?width=800\u0026amp;height=600\u0026amp;v=1dc0778c459ed50\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 1x, https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/l00lpdtp/board-453758_1280.jpg?width=1600\u0026amp;height=1200\u0026amp;v=1dc0778c459ed50\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 2x\u0022 height=\u0022600\u0022 src=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/l00lpdtp/board-453758_1280.jpg?width=160\u0026amp;height=120\u0026amp;v=1dc0778c459ed50\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75\u0022 width=\u0022800\u0022/\u003E\n\u003C/picture\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022info\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022heading md base-heading\u0022\u003EFive tips to make digital progress when you have limited resources\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022text base-text\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003EIn this post we look at five ways to make digital progress without the need for actual spending.\u003Cspan\u003E\u00A0\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C!-- Meta --\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022meta base-text\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022date\u0022\u003E\u003Ctime\u003E01 Aug 2025\u003C/time\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv c